  "definition": "Duties of the Distribution Utility",
  "effectiveDate": "2020-09-14",
  "historyNote": "#10502, INTERIM, eff 1-3-14, EXPIRED: 7-2-14 New. #10757, eff 1-8-15 (from Puc 909.07); ss by #13080, eff 9-14-20",
